\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\qj\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0
\f0\b\fs32 \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Expansion
\f1\b0  into multiple villages and districts through a franchise/cooperative model.
