\f0\b\fs32 \cf2 GOAL
\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \
\pard\pardeftab720\fi960\sa213\qj\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 SPEED Trust envisions a green, sustainable, and self-reliant society where environmental preservation and livelihood creation go hand in hand. Through collaborative initiatives, technical expertise, and community-driven action, SPEED aims to drive long-term ecological and socio-economic transformation in South India and beyond.
\fs29\fsmilli14667 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qj\partightenfactor0

